      "culture": {
        "title": "Family titles instead of names",
        "text": "In the Philippines you rarely call older relatives by their first name. Use the title: Nanay or Nay, Tatay or Tay, Kuya for older brothers. Younger ones are often called Inday (girls) and Dodong or Dong (boys)."
      }
